        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-07-11T22:24:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added the delay back with a note.\n\nIf you are using this driver, you have to define the board_set_tcpc_power_mode otherwise it won\u0027t compile",
      "parentUuid": "ac660cb0_d128ff31",
      "revId": "859f09bb4fdd84de89bf39a8f03ca54d9880d00b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
